{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14258","headline":"缑氏拜陵回道中呈李舍人少尹 · 窦牟","name":"缑氏拜陵回道中呈李舍人少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽忝诸卿位，仍陪长者车。\n礼容皆若旧，名籍自凭虚。\n上路花偏早，空山云甚余。\n却愁新咏发，酬和不相如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}